<section id="S4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Selector Components and Sensitivity</h3>

<div id="S4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
