and 2D AD over the same five test seeds. Panel (a) uses the clean frozen fields
and configurations from the main comparison and extends the three-point
comparison to the complete seven-point threshold path. Each STLSQ row uses
the first generation weak system, so only the threshold changes.</p>
</div>
